ing, knowledge work, and long-horizon agentic workflows, and is particularly strong at navigating large repositories, using tools, debugging, and iterating against images, logs, tests, and runtime feedback. Its architecture uses KDA and Attention Residuals for computational efficiency.</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-7 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5"><div class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-border bg-card px-3 py-2.5"><div class="flex min-h-5 items-center justify-between gap-1.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-2xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground">Modalities</div></div><div class="mt-1 text-base font-medium leading-tight tabular-nums"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md size-5 bg-modality-text/12" id="base-ui-_R_3aomebsnqbt3dml9ivb_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-type size-3 text-modality-text" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v16"></path><path d="M4 7V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h14a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v2"></path><path d="M9 20h6"></path></svg></span><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md size-5 bg-modality-image/12" id="base-ui-_R_3iomebsnqbt3dml9ivb_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-image size-3 text-modality-image" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"></circle><path d="m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21"></path></svg></span><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md size-5 bg-modality-video/12" id="base-ui-_R_3qomebsnqb